  "current_snapshot": {
    "description": "A new set of OVAT rules were released by [person], the OVAT ruleset will be added via SW and will be available for Integration5. Below are the details quoted from Chris' email communication:\n \nA new OCA Plus OVAT Ruleset is available for Genexus 6.8. It can be found here:\n \nhttp://foslsvap01p.corp.life:8081/nexus/content/repositories/public/com/lifetech/oncomine/ovat-off-cycle/oncomine_comprehensive_plus/6.8.2/\n \nChange Log\n \nFix incorrect annotation for OMINDEL1050 (IRS-28927)\n\nFix incorrect annotation for COSM26720 when alternate coding syntax is present (IRS-28961)\n\n cc-ed: [person], [person]",
    "created": "2022-04-27T21:21:29.000+0530",
    "updated": "2025-11-19T19:29:19.328+0530",
