    },
    {
      "id": "1501891",
      "created": "2022-05-09T10:38:16.000+0530",
      "updated": "2022-05-09T10:38:16.000+0530",
      "text": "updated ovat rule sets (plus,universal,ocav3,precission,ronin) in software for integration#5 build. These changes are available as part of 6.7.17 build. \nChanges has to be verified with clean server where server got updated from 6.6.x to 6.7.17\nPR: https://github.com/thermofisher/csd-gx-analysis-pipeline/pull/278/files",
      "truncated": false,
      "source": {
        "path": "data/raw/connected/jira/batch_probe.json",
        "sha256": "6dc4ac43f5365685a9bef55df70bc7800ea54d62d0f3f6c8fbf57e34cc1ce8a1",
        "url": "https://lsg-thermofisher.atlassian.net/browse/IRS-29057?focusedCommentId=1501891",
        "locator": "issue:IRS-29057/comment:1501891",
        "collected_at": "2026-11-01T03:33:09.031Z",
        "local_source_sha256": "6dc4ac43f5365685a9bef55df70bc7800ea54d62d0f3f6c8fbf57e34cc1ce8a1",
        "source_hash_matches": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1501900",
      "created": "2022-06-07T23:10:41.000+0530",
      "updated": "2022-06-07T23:10:41.000+0530",
      "text": "Verified on thanos.itw and hela.itw, both upgraded from 6.6.0 to 6.7.18, the ruleset files provided by Chris were not implemented.\nThe same observation was made by [person] (IRS-28927).",
      "truncated": false,
      "source": {
        "path": "data/raw/connected/jira/batch_probe.json",
        "sha256": "6dc4ac43f5365685a9bef55df70bc7800ea54d62d0f3f6c8fbf57e34cc1ce8a1",
        "url": "https://lsg-thermofisher.atlassian.net/browse/IRS-29057?focusedCommentId=1501900",
        "locator": "issue:IRS-29057/comment:1501900",
        "collected_at": "2026-11-01T03:33:09.031Z",
        "local_source_sha256": "6dc4ac43f5365685a9bef55df70bc7800ea54d62d0f3f6c8fbf57e34cc1ce8a1",
        "source_hash_matches": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1501909",
      "created": "2022-06-08T12:17:02.000+0530",
      "updated": "2022-06-08T12:17:02.000+0530",
      "text": "[person] as I mentioned above we have added rulesets in software build. I just checked the thanos.server and found that on Jun 5th folder content got changed and build installed on May 26th. Can you cross check content on clean server with out installing any ADF. I will also check with [person] if he added ruleset in ADF.\nionadmin@thanos:/share/apps/ovat-33/content$ ls -ltr\ntotal 68\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 iruser irgrp 4096 Jan 10 19:59 universal_rna\ndrwxrwxrwx 2 iruser irgrp 4096 May 26 17:54 universal_dna\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 iruser irgrp 4096 May 26 17:54 ronin_rna\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 iruser irgrp 4096 May 26 17:54 ronin_dna\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 iruser irgrp 4096 May 26 17:54 precision_rna_v68\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 iruser irgrp 4096 May 26 17:54 precision_rna\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 iruser irgrp 4096 May 26 17:54 precision_dna_v68\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 iruser irgrp 4096 May 26 17:54 precision_dna\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 iruser irgrp 4096 May 26 17:54 ocav3_rna\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 iruser irgrp 4096 May 26 17:54 ocav3_dna\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 iruser irgrp 4096 May 26 17:54 myeloid_rna\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 iruser irgrp 4096 May 26 17:54 myeloid_dna\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 iruser irgrp 4096 May 26 17:54 hawkeye_rna\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 iruser irgrp 4096 May 26 17:54 hawkeye_dna\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 iruser irgrp 4096 May 26 17:54 brca_dna\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 iruser irgrp 4096 Jun 5 20:17 plus_rna\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 iruser irgrp 4096 Jun 5 20:17 plus_dna\nionadmin@thanos:/share/apps/ovat-33/content$ \ncc:[person],[person]",
      "truncated": false,
      "source": {
        "path": "data/raw/connected/jira/batch_probe.json",
        "sha256": "6dc4ac43f5365685a9bef55df70bc7800ea54d62d0f3f6c8fbf57e34cc1ce8a1",
        "url": "https://lsg-thermofisher.atlassian.net/browse/IRS-29057?focusedCommentId=1501909",
        "locator": "issue:IRS-29057/comment:1501909",
        "collected_at": "2026-11-01T03:33:09.031Z",
        "local_source_sha256": "6dc4ac43f5365685a9bef55df70bc7800ea54d62d0f3f6c8fbf57e34cc1ce8a1",
