    },
    {
      "id": "1501918",
      "created": "2022-06-08T22:47:54.000+0530",
      "updated": "2022-06-08T22:47:54.000+0530",
      "text": "[person]\nOn genexusem7.itw where Gx [host] build was installed after OCAplus 0.0.7 ADF was installed, confirm that the ovat rulest under ovat33 is same as truth data.\nLooks like the cause is that ADF contains an older version of OVAT ruleset and overwrote what was seeded by the SW.\n\ncc-ed: [person], [person]",
      "truncated": false,
      "source": {
        "path": "data/raw/connected/jira/batch_probe.json",
        "sha256": "6dc4ac43f5365685a9bef55df70bc7800ea54d62d0f3f6c8fbf57e34cc1ce8a1",
        "url": "https://lsg-thermofisher.atlassian.net/browse/IRS-29057?focusedCommentId=1501918",
        "locator": "issue:IRS-29057/comment:1501918",
        "collected_at": "2026-11-01T03:33:09.031Z",
        "local_source_sha256": "6dc4ac43f5365685a9bef55df70bc7800ea54d62d0f3f6c8fbf57e34cc1ce8a1",
        "source_hash_matches": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1501926",
      "created": "2022-06-09T00:06:45.000+0530",
      "updated": "2022-06-09T00:06:45.000+0530",
      "text": "[person] I had a chat with [person] and he confirmed that ocaplus ADF also having ovat ruleset bundled. I asked him to remove it in next ADF version.",
      "truncated": false,
      "source": {
        "path": "data/raw/connected/jira/batch_probe.json",
        "sha256": "6dc4ac43f5365685a9bef55df70bc7800ea54d62d0f3f6c8fbf57e34cc1ce8a1",
        "url": "https://lsg-thermofisher.atlassian.net/browse/IRS-29057?focusedCommentId=1501926",
        "locator": "issue:IRS-29057/comment:1501926",
